      "npc" : "Swordman",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Swordman]",
      "translation" : "[劍士]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 49,
      "npc" : "Swordman",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "I see you're retreading the path of the Swordman! Once you've gotten used to brandishing a sword, you can never go back!!",
      "translation" : "看來你又踏上劍士之路了！一旦習慣了揮劍，就再也回不去了！！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 52,
      "npc" : "Swordman",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Swordman]",
      "translation" : "[劍士]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 53,
      "npc" : "Swordman",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Hmm? Ah, you must first master the Basic Skills before you are ready to become a Swordman.",
      "translation" : "嗯？啊，你得先掌握基本技能，才能成為劍士。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 55,
      "npc" : "Swordman",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Swordman]",
      "translation" : "[劍士]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 56,
      "npc" : "Swordman",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Come back to me when you have finished learning the Basic Novice Skills.",
      "translation" : "學完初心者的基本技能後，再回來找我。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 59,
      "npc" : "Swordman",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Swordman]",
      "translation" : "[劍士]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 60,
      "npc" : "Swordman",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Excellent! Let me promote you to a Swordman right away!",
      "translation" : "很好！我馬上就為你轉職成劍士！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 67,
      "npc" : "Swordman",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Swordman]",
      "translation" : "[劍士]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 68,
      "npc" : "Swordman",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Hmm... You look like a well-experienced Swordman. Still, I'm sure that you must train to improve your skills and gain strength!",
      "translation" : "嗯...你看起來已經是個經驗豐富的劍士了。不過，仍然要訓練自己，磨練技藝、增強實力！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 72,
      "npc" : "Swordman",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Swordman]",
      "translation" : "[劍士]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
