      "npc" : "Swordman",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "brings you to us?",
      "translation" : "有什麼事？"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 96,
      "npc" : "Swordman",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Job Change",
      "translation" : "轉職"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 96,
      "npc" : "Swordman",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "About Swordman.",
      "translation" : "關於劍士"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 96,
      "npc" : "Swordman",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "About the Job requirements.",
      "translation" : "關於轉職條件"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 96,
      "npc" : "Swordman",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Cancel.",
      "translation" : "取消"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 99,
      "npc" : "Swordman",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Swordman]",
      "translation" : "[劍士]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 100,
      "npc" : "Swordman",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Job change? Muhahaha! But you're already a Swordman! Be proud and be strong!",
      "translation" : "轉職？哇哈哈哈！可你已經是劍士了！拿出劍士的驕傲，變得更強吧！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 104,
      "npc" : "Swordman",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Swordman]",
      "translation" : "[劍士]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 105,
      "npc" : "Swordman",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Haha! Oh boy. I'm flattered, but you already have another job! Still, I can't blame you...",
      "translation" : "哈哈！哎呀，你這麼嚮往劍士，真讓我受寵若驚，可你已經有其他職業了！不過，也不能怪你..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 109,
      "npc" : "Swordman",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Swordman]",
      "translation" : "[劍士]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 110,
      "npc" : "Swordman",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "So you wish to become a proud Swordman? By all means, please sign up!",
      "translation" : "你想成為一名值得驕傲的劍士？那就來報名吧！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 112,
      "npc" : "Swordman",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Sign up.",
      "translation" : "報名"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 112,
      "npc" : "Swordman",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Cancel.",
      "translation" : "取消"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 116,
      "npc" : "Swordman",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Swordman]",
      "translation" : "[劍士]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 117,
      "npc" : "Swordman",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Ah, yes. Your application will be reviewed as soon as possible.",
      "translation" : "好的，我們會盡快稽核你的申請。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 119,
      "npc" : "Swordman",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Swordman]",
      "translation" : "[劍士]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 120,
      "npc" : "Swordman",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "If you have already met the requirements, you can take an interview right now. Would you like to?",
      "translation" : "如果你已經滿足條件，現在就能參加面試。要參加嗎？"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 122,
      "npc" : "Swordman",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Yes.",
      "translation" : "是"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 122,
      "npc" : "Swordman",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "No.",
      "translation" : "否"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 123,
      "npc" : "Swordman",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Swordman]",
      "translation" : "[劍士]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 124,
      "npc" : "Swordman",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Good, good.",
      "translation" : "很好，很好。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 125,
      "npc" : "Swordman",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Now, let's see...",
      "translation" : "那麼，讓我看看..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 129,
      "npc" : "Swordman",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Swordman]",
      "translation" : "[劍士]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 130,
      "npc" : "Swordman",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Alright then. Feel free to come back whenever you are ready. All you have to do now is meet our requirements. Good luck to you.",
      "translation" : "好，準備好了隨時回來。現在你只要達到我們的要求就行。祝你好運。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 135,
      "npc" : "Swordman",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Swordman]",
      "translation" : "[劍士]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 136,
      "npc" : "Swordman",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Hm? Alright, come back whenever you change your mind. The world can always use another Swordman!",
      "translation" : "嗯？好吧，改變主意後隨時回來。世界永遠需要更多劍士！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 140,
      "npc" : "Swordman",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Swordman]",
      "translation" : "[劍士]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 142,
      "npc" : "Swordman",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Hm, you still haven't learned all of the Basic Skills. You need to do that before you can become a Swordman.",
      "translation" : "嗯，你還沒學會所有基本技能。想成為劍士，得先把它們學完。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 144,
      "npc" : "Swordman",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Swordman]",
      "translation" : "[劍士]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 145,
      "npc" : "Swordman",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Check the requirements for job change again, and come back when you are ready.",
      "translation" : "再次確認轉職要求，準備好後再回來。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 149,
      "npc" : "Swordman",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Hm, you've learned all of the Basic Skills but didn't take the test yet. You must first pass the exam before you can change your job to Swordman.",
      "translation" : "嗯，你已經學會所有基本技能，不過還沒參加考試。通過考試後，才能轉職為劍士。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 151,
      "npc" : "Swordman",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Swordman]",
      "translation" : "[劍士]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 152,
      "npc" : "Swordman",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Enter the room to my right so that you can take the test. You'll need to speak to my right so you can enter the examination area.",
      "translation" : "去我右邊的房間參加考試。你需要先和右邊的人交談，才能進入考場。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 156,
      "npc" : "Swordman",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Hahaha! Congratulations! Now you are fully qualified to be a real Swordman! I will transform you right away!",
      "translation" : "哈哈哈！恭喜你！現在你完全有資格成為真正的劍士了！我馬上為你辦理轉職！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 161,
      "npc" : "Swordman",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Swordman]",
      "translation" : "[劍士]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 162,
      "npc" : "Swordman",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Once again, congratulations. I expect that you will be a good representative of the Swordman Association.",
      "translation" : "再次恭喜你。希望你能成為劍士公會的優秀代表。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 166,
      "npc" : "Swordman",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Swordman]",
      "translation" : "[劍士]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 167,
      "npc" : "Swordman",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "So you wish to know more about the mighty Swordman job? Well, then...",
      "translation" : "想進一步瞭解強大的劍士職業？好，那就..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 169,
      "npc" : "Swordman",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Swordman]",
      "translation" : "[劍士]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 170,
      "npc" : "Swordman",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Amongst the First Class jobs, the Swordman is the best melee fighter for three reasons.",
      "translation" : "在一轉職業中，劍士是最出色的近戰戰士，原因有三個。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 171,
      "npc" : "Swordman",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "There are 3 reasons why Swordy is the best to approch a fight!",
      "translation" : "劍士最適合迎戰，原因有三個！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 173,
      "npc" : "Swordman",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Swordman]",
      "translation" : "[劍士]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 174,
      "npc" : "Swordman",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "First, Swordman has the benefit of additional HP. Second, Swordman generally have access to a wider selection fo weapons than the other First Class jobs.",
      "translation" : "第一，劍士擁有更高的HP。第二，比起其他一轉職業，劍士能使用的武器種類更多。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 176,
      "npc" : "Swordman",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Swordman]",
      "translation" : "[劍士]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 177,
      "npc" : "Swordman",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "And third, most of the Swordman skills are crushing physical attacks! In my opinion, being a Swordman is the best job ever!",
      "translation" : "第三，劍士的大部分技能都是威力強大的物理攻擊！在我看來，劍士就是最棒的職業！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 180,
      "npc" : "Swordman",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Swordman]",
      "translation" : "[劍士]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 181,
      "npc" : "Swordman",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Hmmm...",
      "translation" : "嗯..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 184,
      "npc" : "Swordman",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "But there's no need to tell you the requirements. You've met them and already became a Swordman! Well, anyway...",
      "translation" : "不過，沒必要跟你說轉職條件了。你早已滿足條件，成為劍士了！總之..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 186,
      "npc" : "Swordman",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "It's too late for you to become a Swordman. You already have another job. Still, there's no harm in telling you...",
      "translation" : "你已經有其他職業，不能再成為劍士了。不過，告訴你也無妨..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 189,
      "npc" : "Swordman",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Swordman]",
      "translation" : "[劍士]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 190,
      "npc" : "Swordman",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "First, you must learn all 9 of the Basic Skills. If you can't complete this requirement, you won't be able to change to any job.",
      "translation" : "首先，必須學會全部9個基本技能。達不到這一要求，就無法轉職成任何職業。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 192,
      "npc" : "Swordman",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Swordman]",
      "translation" : "[劍士]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 193,
      "npc" : "Swordman",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Second, you must pass the Swordman Test. Inquire the Test Manager located in the waiting room of the Swordman Test.",
      "translation" : "其次，必須通過劍士考試。詳情請諮詢劍士考試等候室裡的考試管理員。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 195,
      "npc" : "Swordman",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Swordman]",
      "translation" : "[劍士]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 196,
      "npc" : "Swordman",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "If you can complete these 2 requirements, you can change to a Swordman anytime you want.",
      "translation" : "滿足這兩個條件後，你就可以隨時轉職為劍士。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 199,
      "npc" : "Swordman",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Swordman]",
      "translation" : "[劍士]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 200,
